 teer  setup                                                                                    1/4

  What prepares your reviews?
  teer asks an agent to describe every change. Pick one; `teer setup` changes it later.

  ▌ Claude Code     found                        claude -p, headless
    Codex           not installed                codex exec, read-only
    Anthropic API   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is set     your API key, teer runs the agent
    OpenAI API      OPENAI_API_KEY not set       your API key, teer runs the agent
    OpenRouter      OPENROUTER_API_KEY not set   your API key, teer runs the agent
    Ollama                                       local, no key
    Other API                                    any server that speaks OpenAI's chat completions

  Also used
    git             found                        reads the changes
    gh              not logged in                run `gh auth login`
    nvim            not installed                `e` opens a unit in it
    sandbox-exec    found                        Behavior runs code in it

  Next: a fast model describes every change, a second one checks it.

